        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>贵州茅台酒股份有限公司 2024 年年度报告</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    font-size: 16.5px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    color: #000;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 820px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 46px 58px 30px 58px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .header {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    padding-bottom: 6px;\n    border-bottom: 1.6px solid #000;\n    margin-bottom: 58px;\n  }\n  p {\n    margin: 0 0 2px 0;\n    text-align: justify;\n    text-justify: inter-ideograph;\n  }\n  .indent {\n    text-indent: 2em;\n  }\n  h3.sec {\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 26px 0 16px 0;\n  }\n  h3.sec .num {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 2.6em;\n    padding-left: 0.2em;\n  }\n  h4.sub {\n    font-size: 16.5px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 22px 0 14px 0;\n  }\n  .check {\n    margin: 12px 0 6px 0;\n  }\n  .check .box { letter-spacing: 0.1em; }\n  .unit {\n    text-align: right;\n    margin: 22px 0 2px 0;\n  }\n  table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    table-layout: fixed;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  table td {\n    border: 1px solid #000;\n    padding: 2px 8px;\n    font-size: 16.5px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n  td.right { text-align: right; }\n  td.center { text-align: center; }\n  .note {\n    margin: 2px 0 0 0;\n  }\n  .spacer-lg { height: 34px; }\n  .spacer-md { height: 22px; }\n  .footer {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    margin-top: 52px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"header\">贵州茅台酒股份有限公司 2024 年年度报告</div>\n\n  <p class=\"indent\">报告期内向单个供应商的采购比例超过总额的 50%、前 5 名供应商中存在新增供应商的或严重依赖于少数供应商的情形</p>\n  <p class=\"check\"><span class=\"box\">□适用　√不适用</span></p>\n\n  <h3 class=\"sec\"><span class=\"num\">3、</span>费用</h3>\n  <p class=\"check\"><span class=\"box\">√适用　□不适用</span></p>\n  <p class=\"indent\">销售费用本期 5,639,300,059.49 元，上期 4,648,613,585.82 元，同比增加主要是本期市场推广及服务费增加。</p>\n  <p class=\"indent\">财务费用本期-1,470,219,863.34 元，上期-1,789,503,701.48 元，同比变动主要是本期商业银行存款利率下降。</p>\n\n  <h3 class=\"sec\"><span class=\"num\">4、</span>研发投入</h3>\n\n  <h4 class=\"sub\">(1).研发投入情况表</h4>\n  <p class=\"check\"><span class=\"box\">√适用　□不适用</span></p>\n\n  <div class=\"unit\">单位：元</div>\n  <table>\n    <colgroup><col style=\"width:47%\"><col style=\"width:53%\"></colgroup>\n    <tr><td>本期费用化研发投入</td><td class=\"right\">593,779,816.96</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>本期资本化研发投入</td><td class=\"right\">101,596,918.85</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>研发投入合计</td><td class=\"right\">695,376,735.81</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>研发投入总额占营业收入比例（%）</td><td class=\"right\">0.41</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>研发投入资本化的比重（%）</td><td class=\"right\">14.61</td></tr>\n  </table>\n  <p class=\"note\">注：本期费用化研发支出包括列入生产成本的研发支出及科研人员工资等支出。</p>\n\n  <h4 class=\"sub\">(2).研发人员情况表</h4>\n  <p class=\"check\"><span class=\"box\">√适用　□不适用</span></p>\n\n  <div class=\"spacer-lg\"></div>\n  <table>\n    <colgroup><col style=\"width:63%\"><col style=\"width:37%\"></colgroup>\n    <tr><td>公司研发人员的数量</td><td class=\"right\">801</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>研发人员数量占公司总人数的比例（%）</td><td class=\"right\">2.31</td></tr>\n    <tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"center\">研发人员学历结构</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>学历结构类别</td><td class=\"center\">学历结构人数</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>博士研究生</td><td class=\"right\">84</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>硕士研究生</td><td class=\"right\">174</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>本科</td><td class=\"right\">467</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>专科</td><td class=\"right\">63</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>高中及以下</td><td class=\"right\">13</td></tr>\n    <tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"center\">研发人员年龄结构</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>年龄结构类别</td><td class=\"center\">年龄结构人数</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>30 岁以下（不含 30 岁）</td><td class=\"right\">150</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>30-40 岁（含 30 岁，不含 40 岁）</td><td class=\"right\">413</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>40-50 岁（含 40 岁，不含 50 岁）</td><td class=\"right\">183</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>50-60 岁（含 50 岁，不含 60 岁）</td><td class=\"right\">43</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>60 岁及以上</td><td class=\"right\">12</td></tr>\n  </table>\n\n  <div class=\"spacer-lg\"></div>\n  <h4 class=\"sub\">(3).情况说明</h4>\n  <p class=\"check\"><span class=\"box\">□适用　√不适用</span></p>\n\n  <div class=\"spacer-md\"></div>\n  <h4 class=\"sub\">(4).研发人员构成发生重大变化的原因及对公司未来发展的影响</h4>\n  <p class=\"check\"><span class=\"box\">□适用　√不适用</span></p>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">11 / 143</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
